     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">It is just a matter of finding the right data, not so much a matter of if which package you use if you want to do differential methylation analysis.You need to look for bisulfite sequencing data from mouse. Alexander Meissner&#39;s papers have RRBS data from mouse, you can start with that.<div>\r\n<br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Altuna</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
