-data-rrbs-in-r.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://zvfak.blogspot.ch/2013/03/using-encode-methylation-data-rrbs-in-r.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793235052288000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2kJRdQ3ww7rUeb6CAzh7xs\">http://zvfak.blogspot.ch/2013/<u></u><u></u>03/using-encode-methylation-<u></u>da<u></u>ta-rrbs-in-r.html</a><br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Altuna</div></div></div><div><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div>On Fri, May 10, 2013 at 12:04 PM, SF <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">ess...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n\r\n</div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div>Hello people <br><br>I use MethylKit but I dont have controle file....<br><br>just one file with % Gc, position, chromosome, ID,count and length ....<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n<br>Is possible just one file where I have my data use this link <a href=\"http://code.google.com/p/methylkit/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://code.google.com/p/methylkit/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793235052288000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1RlvN8Ku5M2OVU-ZDa9kAg\">http://code.google.com/p/<u></u>methy<u></u>lkit/</a><br><br><span lang=\"en\"><span>Anyone ever</span> <span>used any</span> <span>script</span> <span>in</span> <span>R</span> <span>to find</span> <span>notes</span> <span>as well as</span> <span>for</span> <span>basic</span> <span>analysis</span> <span>so</span> <span>data file</span><span>?<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n<br>Thanks for the help<span><font color=\"#888888\"><br><br>SF<br></font></span></span></span></div><span><font color=\"#888888\"><div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;methylkit_discussion&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=